{
  "id": 8859692335303,
  "title": "Personalized Vibrant Cactus and Desert Flowers Quilt Set - Style #4",
  "handle": "personalized-vibrant-cactus-and-desert-flowers-quilt-set-style-4",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise cactus and floral printed quilt bedspread set. Perfect for adding a touch of nature and lively color to your bedroom, this quilt set offers both comfort and a cheerful aesthetic.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Design:</strong> Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, perfect for a nature-inspired bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt set by selecting size options or adding pillowcases and custom names.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91'') to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal and unique present for cactus lovers, home decor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates bright and energizing bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this quilt set is machine washable for simple cleaning and maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> The outer layer is made of breathable soft fabric, with a filling of high-quality silk floss for comfortable use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Can be used as a bed quilt, picnic mat, or throw blanket, suitable for beds, sofas, backyard, and camping.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Style #1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Southwestern Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
